																		So I&#039;ve had this tale in my head forever...
															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dexanote" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(481882); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=481882&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610097674" alt="Dexanote" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=481882)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dexanote" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(481882); return false;" >Dexanote</a></span> <span class="odate time_1485235490 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">24 Jan 2017 05:24</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2732630">
									

<p>&#8230; And I decided that I might as well see if I could make it work here. Finished it up tonight, though I was working on it on and off over the course of the last week or so.</p>
<p>I made the original page when I had 3 minutes left, then went through on editing to adjust some grammar and a bit of continuity fixes. Then Chrome stopped responding and I panic-reposted either right before or right after the deadline. Communism-will-win kindly put in a rating module when I missed it while reposting.</p>
<p>I don't expect this to be teriffically popular but I absolutely love the Talks With Mann and I love the idea of Administrator I having nice chats with a random Dr he made friends with every week. I'll probably make a couple more in the same style, this was fun. Will absolutely clean it up and adjust this entire tale after the contest is over, the idea deserves a somewhat better execution.</p>
<p>I tried to have the Administrator sound like an old movie or TV actor. Black and white style, stilted and declarative. Not sure if that translates.</p>
<p>for now, enjoy</p>

							</div>

								
