														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2732800">
									

<p>I'm also not sure I see the history connection. Overall, this didn't add up to much from my perspective. The run-down of 231 was almost exactly that - a run-down of the events from the mainlist article - and the deliberate lack of emotion from the Administrator prevented those events being seen from a new perspective, or new light being brought to the character of the Administrator himself.</p>

							</div>

								
					
